    "summary": "In the [Shoot Step](vsdata:core-rule/shoot-step), a unit can be picked even without a ranged weapon if it otherwise qualifies. It attacks zero times and still resolves its shooting type. A unit without melee weapons can likewise be picked in the [Fight Step](vsdata:core-rule/fight-step) and resolves its fight type without attacking.",
